  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>欢迎来到Sakura，这个模组融合了竹子、WA和枫树。</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2020/07/25/XmQ8N1SBjJKhFy6.png\"></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\">这个模组充满了日本风格，包括定食、寿司和许多美食。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">新的战斗风格，使用你的武士刀和短刀，在篝火和烹饪锅中烹饪。</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">新的灾厄村民带着他的武士刀出现在竹林和枫树林中！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">新增服装：和服、浴衣和羽织。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">尽情享受~</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong>官方宣传视频：</strong></h4><p><strong><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/eaTCFOl_YyQ?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\">截图：</span></strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2020/07/25/aoQGLIkAwTb5z9s.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1519\" height=\"792\"><img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2020/07/25/g8k9wzsUV7ZBpAn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1114\" height=\"580\"><img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2020/07/25/7N4ioG1OHFQwtb2.png\"><img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2020/07/25/i8OR6hEB2IXyDHA.png\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Syameimaru的Patreon链接：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/syameimaru_zheng\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.patreon.com/syameimaru_zheng</a></p>",
